{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">英國最繁忙渡輪港口多佛爾，一度因示威影響運作。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">數百名身穿黑衣的人，周六阻塞通往多佛爾港的道路，造成長達超過六公里的車龍，不少乘搭渡輪的旅客行程受阻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.PROTEST-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269ChaQpQBOg1788614253.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.UK.PROTEST-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據報示威者的訴求是反對非法移民進入英國。他們後來由警方引領下，遊行到火車站然後散去。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T13:30:49.397366+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}